hyperactive-interaction-in-the-words-of-the-human-superorganism-37 = unlines (cons "*Category* is the speaking-against in the assembly, *kata* + *agoreuein*. To categorize was to accuse in public. Fields that agree on what to be ignorant about are categories in that sense: accusations that became walls. *Concept* is *con* + *capere*, taken together; *comprehend* is *com* + *prehendere*, grasped together. *Abstract* is *abs* + *trahere*, drawn away. Abstraction is literally a drawing-away from the thing. Collapsing false disciplinary distinctions undoes the category's accusation and pulls the abstraction back to what it was drawn from." nil)
